# ==========================================
# SECURITY & COMPLIANCE (.gitignore)
# Standard: Zero-Secret & Raw PII Isolation
# ==========================================

# 1. Raw Client Intake (Keep raw PII in M365 SharePoint / local staging only)
00-raw/*
!00-raw/.gitkeep

# 2. Environment Variables & Secrets (Cursor, Vercel, Supabase, M365)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*secret*
*credentials*
*token*

# 3. Local Databases & Scratchpads
*.sqlite
*.db
*.csv
*.xlsx
scratchpad/
tmp/

# 4. OS & IDE Artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.cursor/rules/*.local.md
